= New Year 1924

The year began with French soldiers in Essen. It ends with a new currency, a general holding emergency powers, and a Republic that is still standing.

Five years ago a hundred delegates founded the party in the Prussian Landtag, on the last days of December 1918. [? if kpd_banned = 1 : On New Year's Eve 1923 the party is banned, and its Central Committee meets in a flat with the curtains drawn. ?][? if kpd_banned = 0 : On New Year's Eve 1923 the party is legal, and its offices on the Rosenthaler Strasse are open. ?]

- @finish: Look back over the five years.

@finish
go-to: game_over
